# Important Difference From `.map`

# `.map`

transform ALL items into something new.

# Filtering/selecting

keep ONLY certain items.

---

# Example

`.map`

```ruby id="xmlns367"
numbers.map { |number| number * 2 }
```

Transforms everything.

---

Filtering:

```ruby id="xmlns368"
numbers.select { |number| number.even? }
```

Keeps only matching items.

